  "worked_solution": "Notice that we have a block diagonal matrix. Therefore, its determinant is equal to the product of the diagonal blocks' determinants:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}r & 1 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 3t & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -25\\end{aligned}| & =|\\begin{aligned}r & 1 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 3t & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -25\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}r & 1 \\\\ 5 & 3t\\end{aligned}|\\cdot (-25) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{5}\\cdot (-25) \\\\  & =-15.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
